flowchart LR
  N1["Propose exact redactions<br/>Permitted original and version<br/>Exact Unicode ranges and rationale<br/>Audience, purpose and expiry"]
  N2["Independent plan review<br/>Different cleared lawyer decides<br/>Whole-document review required<br/>A preview is not sanitization"]
  N3["Build a new transcript<br/>Reconstruct sanitized text as PDF<br/>Exclude original metadata and objects<br/>Validate the generated bytes"]
  N4["Approve exact output<br/>Independent Legal SME decision<br/>Additional antitrust gate if required<br/>Bind decisions to retained hashes"]
  N5["Release to a named audience<br/>Only the intended organization<br/>Purpose and expiry are enforced<br/>Native Word and Excel not released"]
  N6["Recheck future access<br/>Source or approval changes can deny<br/>Search uses released transcript units<br/>Downloaded copies cannot be recalled"]
  N1 --> N2
  N2 --> N3
  N3 --> N4
  N4 --> N5
  N5 --> N6
